# B-337: Payload variant equality test.
# Constructor [Ok value: a] generates [fn [let value] [variant "Result.Ok" [value: value]]].
# Two calls to [Ok value: 1] create identical variants with payload {value: 1}.
# Variant equality compares both tag and payload.
[Result: [type [let a] [Ok value: a] [Error msg: Str]]]
[eq: [= [Ok value: 1] [Ok value: 1]]]
=== out
Dict({"eq": Variant(Boolean.True, Null)})
